    "short": "St Mary's Church, Vendore is a much-loved spiritual town in Kerala, known for temples and pilgrimage.",
    "description": "St. Mary's Church (Malayalam: സെന്റ് മേരീസ്‌ പള്ളി) is a Syro-Malabar Catholic church in Vendore, Thrissur district, Kerala, India. It is known for its patronage of lady Mother Mary and is part of the Archdiocese of Thrissur. Vendore Parish is also known by the name Vendore Amma (Malayalam: വെണ്ടോരമ്മ), comes under the jurisdiction of Pudukkad Forona, and is located between Amballur and Mannampetta 200 m from Vendore Junction.",
